      <p source="#source-594-980"><seg source="#source-594-684">別紙、乙（姉乙女）に送り候書状ハ、養子清次郎を論じて遣候事在</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-684-696">レ</note><seg source="#source-696-894">之候間、愚兄権平ニハ見せられぬ事おゝく候まゝ、必大兄御母上まで御送り愚兄ニハ小弟より手紙のあねニ達し候ことをしらせぬよふ御母上より御</seg><ruby type="furigana" rend="right" source="#source-894-918"><rb>直</rb><rt>（じき）</rt></ruby><seg source="#source-918-930">ニ御達可</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-930-942">レ</note><seg source="#source-942-945">被</seg><note type="kunten" subtype="return-mark" rend="subscript" source="#source-945-957">レ</note><seg source="#source-957-980">遣御願申上候。</seg></p>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-980-1041" style="padding-inline-start: 1em">
        <p source="#source-1001-1041"><seg source="#source-1001-1013">廿四日朝</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1013-1041" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1031-1041">頓首</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p source="#source-1041-1085"><seg source="#source-1041-1056">望月清平様</seg><seg type="layout" source="#source-1056-1085" rend="chitsuki align(right) offset-from-end(0)" snh:layout-kind="chitsuki" snh:layout-params="align=right;offset-from-end=0"><seg source="#source-1074-1085">才谷拝</seg></seg></p>
      </div>
      <div type="layout" source="#source-1085-1112" style="padding-inline-start: 5em">
        <p source="#source-1106-1112"><seg source="#source-1106-1112">机下</seg></p>
      </div>
    </body>
